			 Departments 		 

































				 You can find contact information and links to each Town Department below. Many departments have offices located at Town Hall. Town Hall 173 Main St. Groton, MA 01450   Accounting (978) 448-1107 accountant@grotonma.gov Assessors (978) 448-1127 assessors@grotonma.gov Building Department (978) 448-1109 building@grotonma.gov Cable Access (978) 448-3796 committee@thegrotonchannel.org Conservation  (978) 448-1106 conservation@grotonma.gov Fire Department (978) 448-6333 fire@grotonma.gov Groton Electric Light Department (978) 448-1150   info@grotonelectric.org Groton Water Department (978) 448-1122 water@grotonma.gov Department of Public Works (978) 448-1162 highway@grotonma.gov Housing Coordinator (978) 732-1913 fstanley@grotonma.gov Human Resources (978) 448-1145 humanresources@grotonma.gov Information Technology (978) 732-1889 itdept@grotonma.gov Library (978) 448-1167 info@gpl.org Land Use (978) 448-1105 landuse@grotonma.gov Police Department (978) 448-5555 police@grotonma.gov Senior Center (978) 448-1170 gcoa@grotonma.gov Town Clerk (978) 448-1100 townclerk@grotonma.gov Town Manager (978) 448-1111 selectboard@grotonma.gov Treasurer & Tax Collector (978) 448-1103 treasurer@grotonma.gov Veteran’s Services (978) 448-1175 veteran@grotonma.gov West Groton Water Department (978) 448-3711 info@westgrotonwater.org 					 































